 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 545736,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine whether the Condorcet criterion applies based on the summary of ranked ballots given in the table below.<br>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Votes</th>\n<th>3</th>\n<th>2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option A</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option C</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>An X represents crossing out a cell.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%; background: linear-gradient(to top right, transparent calc(50% - 1px), black 50%, transparent calc(50% + 1px) )\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Opponent<br>Runner</th>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>B</th>\n<th>C</th>\n<th>Points</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>AB 3 wins</td>\n<td>AC 2<p></p>\n<p>wins</p></td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>BA 2<p></p>\n<p>Cross out BA 2</p></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>BC 5<p></p>\n<p>wins</p></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>CA 2<p></p>\n<p>Cross out CA 2</p></td>\n<td>CB 0<p></p>\n<p>Cross out CB 0</p></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Option A is a Condorcet candidate because Option A won every matchup.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Yes, because Option A is a Condorcet candidate. "
    }
   ],
